---
import TreatmentLayout from '../../components/TreatmentLayout.astro';
import PriceBlock from '../../components/PriceBlock.astro';
import {
  colourConsultation,
  permanentColour,
  semiPermanentColour,
  toner,
} from '../../data/services';
import { images } from '../../data/images';
import { waLink } from '../../data/site';
---

<TreatmentLayout
  title="Colouring"
  metaTitle="Colouring: permanent, semi-permanent and toner"
  description="Colouring at Maison Coiffure: permanent colour from €49, semi-permanent colour from €39 and toners from €30, always preceded by a personal €25 consultation that is deducted from the agreed treatment."
  lede="Colour that suits your hair, agreed together before anything touches it."
  image={images.colourCopper}
  ctaLabel="Book a colour consultation"
  waMessage="Hello Maison Coiffure, I would like to book a Colour and Highlight Consultation."
>
  <p>
    Permanent colour provides lasting colour change and grey coverage. Semi-permanent colour adds
    tone, depth and richness and fades gradually. A toner makes a softer, translucent tonal
    adjustment, neutralises unwanted warmth or refreshes shine. Neither semi-permanent colour nor
    toner makes hair lighter.
  </p>
  <p>
    Before your first colour, toner or highlight treatment we assess your hair history, current
    condition and desired result in a personal consultation, then agree the service, the time it
    needs and the estimated price. The €25 consultation fee is fully deducted from the agreed
    treatment when you proceed.
  </p>
  <p>
    Not sure what to book?
    <a href={waLink('Hello Maison Coiffure, I have a question about colouring.')} rel="noopener">
      Contact Maison Coiffure via WhatsApp</a> for guidance.
  </p>

  <Fragment slot="after">
    <PriceBlock group={colourConsultation} headingLevel="h2" />
    <PriceBlock group={permanentColour} headingLevel="h2" />
    <PriceBlock group={semiPermanentColour} headingLevel="h2" />
    <PriceBlock group={toner} headingLevel="h2" />
  </Fragment>
</TreatmentLayout>
